1
00:00:38,038 --> 00:00:40,666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

2
00:00:45,629 --> 00:00:50,759
"I will name the bird 'Queen,'
but remember, he is male."

3
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,513
You're a male bird?

4
00:00:59,518 --> 00:01:02,354
Wonderful.

5
00:01:12,864 --> 00:01:16,409
I heard that you would eat fish,
yet you haven't touched it.

6
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:20,580
So perhaps you'd prefer
some sort of insect?

7
00:01:21,707 --> 00:01:23,250
How about we try…

8
00:01:25,335 --> 00:01:26,794
caterpillars or flies?

9
00:01:34,845 --> 00:01:36,178
Thank goodness.

10
00:01:36,179 --> 00:01:37,931
I'm quite afraid of insects.

11
00:01:55,157 --> 00:01:57,034
OFFICIAL DOCUMENT OF THE IMPERIAL
HOUSEHOLD MISTRESS CONTRACT

12
00:02:04,166 --> 00:02:05,292
Ah!

13
00:02:06,293 --> 00:02:09,588
I heard that a lot of birds
like their feathers patted.

14
00:02:10,255 --> 00:02:11,465
Do you like that, too?

15
00:02:25,312 --> 00:02:27,439
You're adorable.

16
00:03:39,052 --> 00:03:41,262
How can you name a male "Queen"?

17
00:03:41,263 --> 00:03:42,597
What are you talking about?

18
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:46,308
Weren't you out scouting
like you were supposed to?

19
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:48,311
Did you wander off somewhere else again?

20
00:03:49,229 --> 00:03:51,440
No. I was out scouting.

21
00:03:52,232 --> 00:03:54,317
Scouting…

22
00:03:55,902 --> 00:03:57,612
into another woman's heart again?

23
00:03:59,072 --> 00:04:01,449
No, no, just the Imperial Palace.

24
00:04:01,450 --> 00:04:02,576
You shouldn't say that.

25
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:10,708
Sire, please,

26
00:04:10,709 --> 00:04:13,253
I really need you to be more careful
with how you act!

27
00:04:15,589 --> 00:04:18,132
You can't ever forget the fact
that you are the first in line

28
00:04:18,133 --> 00:04:19,926
to the throne of the Western Kingdom.

29
00:04:24,890 --> 00:04:28,477
 <i>"I wish I could be like Queen
and fly the skies.</i>

30
00:04:34,024 --> 00:04:37,110
<i>"I wonder how the world would look
from so high up.</i>

31
00:04:40,071 --> 00:04:43,532
<i>"Even majestic mountains
and the boundless sea</i>

32
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:45,911
<i>"would seem small from such heights.</i>

33
00:04:48,371 --> 00:04:53,292
<i>"How trivial and insignificant
human worries and sorrows would become</i>

34
00:04:53,293 --> 00:04:55,462
<i>"when you're soaring through the clouds."</i>

35
00:05:02,052 --> 00:05:03,553
OFFICIAL DOCUMENT OF THE IMPERIAL
HOUSEHOLD MISTRESS CONTRACT

36
00:05:06,056 --> 00:05:09,267
EMPRESS NAVIER ELLIE TROVI

37
00:05:55,063 --> 00:05:56,480
Her Majesty, sire.

38
00:05:56,481 --> 00:05:59,984
She's signed the contract that approves
Ms. Rashta as your mistress.

39
00:05:59,985 --> 00:06:03,947
EMPEROR SOVIESHU TROVI VICTOR
EMPRESS NAVIER ELLIE TROVI

40
00:06:04,990 --> 00:06:07,700
We'd usually hold a banquet
to celebrate the registration.

41
00:06:07,701 --> 00:06:10,537
However, it coincides
with the New Year's Ceremony.

42
00:06:11,121 --> 00:06:12,621
I'll meet the Empress soon.

43
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:14,040
I'll talk with her.

44
00:06:15,292 --> 00:06:17,126
- Proceed.
- Yes.

45
00:06:17,127 --> 00:06:20,839
Ah, and what shall we do
about the request from Lady Albani?

46
00:06:25,343 --> 00:06:29,138
Are you saying His Majesty took
the side of his mistress so blatantly?

47
00:06:29,139 --> 00:06:30,639
Yes, right in front of Her Majesty

48
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,224
and with all the ladies-in-waiting.

49
00:06:32,225 --> 00:06:35,394
Oh my. That puts the Empress
in a very awkward position.

50
00:06:35,395 --> 00:06:37,771
It wasn't just awkward.
It was humiliating.

51
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:42,152
You look even more beautiful today,
Your Majesty.

52
00:06:46,948 --> 00:06:48,074
I'll do that.

53
00:06:54,414 --> 00:06:56,833
She told me she called you "sister."

54
00:06:58,376 --> 00:07:00,210
It was only later I realized

55
00:07:00,211 --> 00:07:03,340
how disconcerting
that must have been for you.

56
00:07:08,511 --> 00:07:10,179
She only called you that

57
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:14,266
as she thought I would feel more at ease
if she got along with you like family.

58
00:07:15,977 --> 00:07:17,270
Isn't she innocent?

59
00:07:22,734 --> 00:07:23,942
Let us begin.

60
00:07:23,943 --> 00:07:25,278
Yes, Your Majesty.

61
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:33,953
Lady Albani had demands, I presume?

62
00:07:34,496 --> 00:07:36,998
Did she want recompense
for sponsoring Ms. Rashta?

63
00:07:38,375 --> 00:07:40,418
Nothing is ever free in this world.

64
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:42,087
Tell me…

65
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:46,132
Did you grant a pardon
for the Grand Duke, Your Majesty?

66
00:07:47,050 --> 00:07:48,550
Out of the question.

67
00:07:48,551 --> 00:07:52,639
I returned their family crest
and estate in Lucevan, which I had seized.

68
00:07:55,225 --> 00:07:58,018
As for Rashta's banquet,
we shall do as you wish.

69
00:07:58,019 --> 00:07:59,729
Then we shall abstain, Your Majesty.

70
00:08:03,066 --> 00:08:05,317
With so many important guests
in attendance,

71
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:07,319
the ceremony
will not be eclipsed by scandal.

72
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,987
I agree with you.

73
00:08:08,988 --> 00:08:11,616
It is the grandest festival
of the Imperial Palace,

74
00:08:12,867 --> 00:08:14,202
and also a day for us.

75
00:08:17,372 --> 00:08:19,499
Please smile, Your Majesties.

76
00:08:24,713 --> 00:08:27,756
"A mistress cannot be entered
into the imperial family register,

77
00:08:27,757 --> 00:08:29,466
"the same for any child born to her."

78
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:31,970
"They cannot obtain the rights
of imperial royalty."

79
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:36,098
What does that mean though?

80
00:08:36,099 --> 00:08:38,642
It's saying that if you had any children,

81
00:08:38,643 --> 00:08:41,770
they cannot have the title
"prince" or "princess," I'm afraid.

82
00:08:41,771 --> 00:08:43,397
- Even if the child is royal?
- Yes.

83
00:08:43,398 --> 00:08:46,400
Even if you give birth to a child
who looks identical to the Emperor,

84
00:08:46,401 --> 00:08:49,236
Eastern Empire laws require
the descendants of a mistress

85
00:08:49,237 --> 00:08:50,821
to be managed in a separate genealogy.

86
00:08:50,822 --> 00:08:52,948
You may receive an allowance.

87
00:08:52,949 --> 00:08:54,742
But only whilst you're under contract.

88
00:08:54,743 --> 00:08:56,660
Therefore, once the contract ends,

89
00:08:56,661 --> 00:08:59,414
if it isn't renewed,
you must leave the Imperial Palace.

90
00:09:00,457 --> 00:09:02,459
Are you saying the contract can end?

91
00:09:03,043 --> 00:09:06,545
Typically, the contract is renewed
every two years.

92
00:09:06,546 --> 00:09:08,506
Uh…  Here.

93
00:09:20,852 --> 00:09:23,104
- Would you excuse us?
- Yes.

94
00:09:28,318 --> 00:09:29,319
Here.

95
00:09:35,241 --> 00:09:36,325
MISTRESS CONTRACT

96
00:09:36,326 --> 00:09:37,659
Now, just here,

97
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:40,163
beside Her Majesty's signature
is your name.

98
00:09:42,082 --> 00:09:43,625
You cannot… You're…

99
00:09:44,209 --> 00:09:46,294
You're illiterate.

100
00:09:50,924 --> 00:09:52,133
RASHTA ISHKA BOTULIN

101
00:09:53,384 --> 00:09:54,928
This is how your name is written.

102
00:10:04,479 --> 00:10:05,647
Rashta.

103
00:10:07,816 --> 00:10:10,819
Ish… ka.

104
00:10:12,112 --> 00:10:13,488
Boo…

105
00:10:14,781 --> 00:10:17,075
tuh…

106
00:10:19,369 --> 00:10:21,495
RASHTA ISHKA BOTULIN

107
00:10:21,496 --> 00:10:24,248
…lin.

108
00:10:28,086 --> 00:10:29,878
You are all done.

109
00:10:29,879 --> 00:10:31,131
I'm sorry…

110
00:10:31,798 --> 00:10:34,591
Can you give Ms. Rashta and I
some time alone, please?

111
00:10:34,592 --> 00:10:37,094
She'll have questions about life
in the Imperial Palace

112
00:10:37,095 --> 00:10:38,720
and may have concerns

113
00:10:38,721 --> 00:10:40,515
that she can only confide
to another woman.

114
00:10:44,644 --> 00:10:47,688
This is different from what I hoped.

115
00:10:47,689 --> 00:10:50,941
I heard I won't have a celebratory banquet
due to the New Year's Ceremony.

116
00:10:50,942 --> 00:10:53,402
I thought His Majesty
would at least be here

117
00:10:53,403 --> 00:10:56,280
and celebrate with me
and show his gratitude.

118
00:10:56,281 --> 00:11:00,033
With the New Year's Ceremony so close,
His Majesty is indisposed.

119
00:11:00,034 --> 00:11:01,493
Also, look at the contract.

120
00:11:01,494 --> 00:11:05,206
He can keep me around for two years,
then throw me out once he grows tired.

121
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:08,835
Rashta, now see here!

122
00:11:11,379 --> 00:11:12,754
Don't you understand

123
00:11:12,755 --> 00:11:15,299
that from now,
you're a daughter of Botulin House?

124
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:18,261
Being thrown out, now that
you're one of us, will never happen.

125
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:20,387
I say so.

126
00:11:24,642 --> 00:11:27,187
These are black diamonds.
Aren't they lovely?

127
00:11:28,855 --> 00:11:32,192
They are only for the women
of Botulin House.

128
00:11:33,276 --> 00:11:34,402
Here.

129
00:11:50,793 --> 00:11:54,630
Congratulations on becoming
His Majesty's woman.

130
00:12:06,434 --> 00:12:10,271
I will set a suitable date for a banquet
in your honor, Ms. Rashta.

131
00:12:11,564 --> 00:12:13,148
Keep your chin tucked in,

132
00:12:13,149 --> 00:12:16,069
lift your chest, keep your back straight,

133
00:12:16,653 --> 00:12:18,488
and your gaze forward.

134
00:12:19,113 --> 00:12:22,616
I will turn you into a noble lady,

135
00:12:22,617 --> 00:12:27,080
who is suited to His Majesty
and his way of life.

136
00:12:32,961 --> 00:12:34,044
<i>2,000 fireworks,</i>

137
00:12:34,045 --> 00:12:36,338
<i>5,000 packs of cigarettes,</i>

138
00:12:36,339 --> 00:12:39,174
<i>300 casks of whiskey, 400 boxes of caviar,</i>

139
00:12:39,175 --> 00:12:41,009
<i>200 horses and 50 carriages.</i>

140
00:12:41,010 --> 00:12:43,595
<i>As for meat… beef, mutton, and chicken.</i>

141
00:12:43,596 --> 00:12:46,390
And finally, we have 5,000 kegs of beer.

142
00:12:46,391 --> 00:12:47,933
Thank you.

143
00:12:47,934 --> 00:12:50,519
See that it's well prepared
for our subjects to enjoy,

144
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:51,603
as well as our guests.

145
00:12:51,604 --> 00:12:53,106
Yes.

146
00:12:55,817 --> 00:12:58,944
It is today that Laura's
punishment ends, is it not?

147
00:12:58,945 --> 00:13:00,029
- Yes.
- Yes.

148
00:13:00,655 --> 00:13:03,700
Our other engagement,
the dress fitting, you can postpone it.

149
00:13:04,701 --> 00:13:07,578
I will prepare to fetch Lady Laura.

150
00:13:17,005 --> 00:13:18,006
Sister!

151
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:27,307
Good day, Your Majesty.

152
00:13:29,392 --> 00:13:32,020
I was just on my way to see you, my lady.

153
00:13:32,979 --> 00:13:35,355
I have something to share
with Your Majesty.

154
00:13:35,356 --> 00:13:37,232
My adoptive mother gave me caramels.

155
00:13:37,233 --> 00:13:39,610
They're so delicious
I thought you'd like to try a piece.

156
00:13:47,118 --> 00:13:48,286
Your Majesty…

157
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:52,123
why do you have
such a scary look on your face?

158
00:13:53,374 --> 00:13:54,792
I do not want you to bring me things.

159
00:13:55,835 --> 00:13:57,253
And also…

160
00:13:58,212 --> 00:13:59,380
refrain from visiting me.

161
00:13:59,964 --> 00:14:03,217
It's not as though we are on such terms
that we enjoy seeing each other.

162
00:14:04,594 --> 00:14:06,637
Then we can try and get on good terms. I…

163
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:10,641
I'd like to become close friends
with Your Majesty.

164
00:14:12,643 --> 00:14:14,144
There's no need to act this way.

165
00:14:14,145 --> 00:14:15,772
When the next mistress arrives,

166
00:14:16,481 --> 00:14:18,983
you can become close
with her instead of me.

167
00:14:20,902 --> 00:14:22,445
"The next mistress"?

168
00:14:23,071 --> 00:14:24,654
But of course.

169
00:14:24,655 --> 00:14:26,491
There will be others
once he's done with you.

170
00:14:28,409 --> 00:14:29,994
If you just wait a little,

171
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:32,829
you will make plenty of friends.

172
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:36,416
The previous emperor had eight mistresses.

173
00:14:38,503 --> 00:14:42,256
With that many, you can play the ball game
that's popular among the citizen class.

174
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,717
Wouldn't you enjoy that?

175
00:15:12,245 --> 00:15:13,246
Your Majesty!

176
00:15:17,291 --> 00:15:18,750
Your… Your Majesty.

177
00:15:29,428 --> 00:15:31,221
You stayed strong.

178
00:15:31,222 --> 00:15:32,889
You did so well, Laura.

179
00:15:38,229 --> 00:15:40,064
I'll be okay.

180
00:16:20,396 --> 00:16:22,064
I'm here as you requested.

181
00:16:25,151 --> 00:16:26,194
What is it?

182
00:16:26,777 --> 00:16:28,237
Your lady-in-waiting…

183
00:16:29,071 --> 00:16:30,948
the one who was punished…

184
00:16:31,490 --> 00:16:33,159
Daughter of a Marquess.

185
00:16:34,243 --> 00:16:35,995
And her name is Laura Tallital.

186
00:16:40,458 --> 00:16:42,001
I heard you went

187
00:16:42,793 --> 00:16:44,879
and took her…

188
00:16:46,130 --> 00:16:47,548
My lady-in-waiting…

189
00:16:48,132 --> 00:16:50,009
suffered for five whole days.

190
00:16:51,469 --> 00:16:53,679
Did you really have to do that?

191
00:16:54,639 --> 00:16:55,972
How does it make me look

192
00:16:55,973 --> 00:16:58,893
if you go out of your way
to care for someone I punished?

193
00:17:01,854 --> 00:17:04,148
Instead of going to the prison
to fetch her…

194
00:17:07,109 --> 00:17:10,987
you should have cast her out
of the Imperial Palace.

195
00:17:10,988 --> 00:17:13,782
She was only punished
for my sake, Your Majesty.

196
00:17:13,783 --> 00:17:15,742
It would not be right
if she were banished.

197
00:17:15,743 --> 00:17:18,412
Besides, her actions made sense.

198
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:20,664
She merely defended her Empress.

199
00:17:24,377 --> 00:17:27,045
So you will take her side to the very end?

200
00:17:27,046 --> 00:17:29,798
Those ladies are under my authority.

201
00:17:29,799 --> 00:17:31,675
They should only have to answer to me.

202
00:17:31,676 --> 00:17:34,720
How dare you defend the person
that humiliated Rashta?

203
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:41,643
And you said such spiteful things
to that poor girl who knows nothing.

204
00:17:41,644 --> 00:17:43,145
Why have you changed so much?

205
00:17:43,813 --> 00:17:44,896
I was spiteful?

206
00:17:44,897 --> 00:17:47,650
I heard you told Rashta
that I would take another mistress.

207
00:17:49,068 --> 00:17:51,528
Historically, the emperor never takes one.

208
00:17:51,529 --> 00:17:53,364
He takes as many as he pleases.

209
00:17:54,031 --> 00:17:55,783
Have you forgotten your promise…

210
00:17:56,867 --> 00:17:59,369
that you would never take one yourself?

211
00:17:59,370 --> 00:18:03,916
You said that you would not embarrass
your empress as the previous was

212
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:05,835
and let me suffer.

213
00:18:06,752 --> 00:18:09,296
You say Lady Laura humiliated Rashta.

214
00:18:09,297 --> 00:18:13,384
Was it not the same humiliation
to condemn her to prison?

215
00:18:14,635 --> 00:18:16,596
She is my lady-in-waiting.

216
00:18:17,471 --> 00:18:19,764
Your Majesty only chose to punish Laura

217
00:18:19,765 --> 00:18:22,226
to flaunt your command
in front of your mistress.

218
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,563
Anything to please her.

219
00:18:26,063 --> 00:18:29,149
You'll even send the daughter
of a noble house to prison.

220
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:30,526
It was performative power.

221
00:18:31,068 --> 00:18:33,029
- Enough!
- I'm now laughingstock.

222
00:18:33,738 --> 00:18:35,156
You say I've changed?

223
00:18:36,365 --> 00:18:38,993
Lady Laura has borne the brunt
of your harsh actions…

224
00:18:44,248 --> 00:18:46,417
and it has brought disgrace on her family.

225
00:18:47,752 --> 00:18:49,545
Your Majesty, it isn't me…

226
00:18:51,255 --> 00:18:52,798
but you who's been changed.

227
00:19:32,254 --> 00:19:33,255
You've returned.

228
00:19:34,298 --> 00:19:35,674
Where's Lady Laura?

229
00:19:35,675 --> 00:19:37,510
We are taking care of her
as you asked, Your Majesty.

230
00:19:38,094 --> 00:19:39,387
So please, do not worry.

231
00:19:40,054 --> 00:19:41,888
In your chamber, there's a gift for you.

232
00:19:41,889 --> 00:19:44,432
It arrived today, from Duchess Trovi.

233
00:19:44,433 --> 00:19:45,476
From Mother?

234
00:20:26,559 --> 00:20:28,476
<i>"To Her Majesty the Empress.</i>

235
00:20:28,477 --> 00:20:32,230
<i>"I had very much wished to attend this
New Year's Ceremony and see you.</i>

236
00:20:32,231 --> 00:20:36,234
<i>"However, I decided that I must be patient
for a little longer.</i>

237
00:20:36,235 --> 00:20:38,820
<i>"I found myself recalling
the very first time</i>

238
00:20:38,821 --> 00:20:41,157
<i>"I made clothes for you
before you were born.</i>

239
00:20:41,657 --> 00:20:44,534
<i>"Back then,
even the smallest piece of fabric</i>

240
00:20:44,535 --> 00:20:46,870
<i>"was enough to wrap around you."</i>

241
00:20:46,871 --> 00:20:48,038
Little one…

242
00:20:48,998 --> 00:20:51,459
Your mother will make sure
you look lovely.

243
00:20:52,334 --> 00:20:55,086
<i>"It was true before you came
into this world,</i>

244
00:20:55,087 --> 00:20:56,421
<i>"and remains so now.</i>

245
00:20:56,422 --> 00:20:58,591
<i>"You are my most darling treasure.</i>

246
00:20:59,175 --> 00:21:02,803
<i>"I hope this dress will bring Your Majesty
great comfort and bravery.</i>

247
00:21:03,387 --> 00:21:05,472
<i>"The Duke also sends his regards.</i>

248
00:21:05,473 --> 00:21:09,142
<i>"Whenever he misses you,
he gazes upon the olive tree you planted."</i>

249
00:21:10,269 --> 00:21:12,937
<i>"That tree now casts quite a big shadow.</i>

250
00:21:12,938 --> 00:21:14,230
<i>"My beloved Majesty.</i>

251
00:21:14,231 --> 00:21:15,816
<i>"Please take courage!"</i>

252
00:21:16,358 --> 00:21:20,111
<i>"To my beloved younger sister,
Her Majesty the Empress.</i>

253
00:21:20,112 --> 00:21:22,156
<i>"We fought another small battle today.</i>

254
00:21:22,740 --> 00:21:24,574
<i>"We are clearing out the remnant forces,</i>

255
00:21:24,575 --> 00:21:26,868
<i>"so we may be able
to move up the peace talks.</i>

256
00:21:26,869 --> 00:21:28,787
<i>"If these talks make progress,</i>

257
00:21:28,788 --> 00:21:32,373
<i>"the greatest threat
to the Eastern Empire may disappear.</i>

258
00:21:32,374 --> 00:21:35,960
<i>"Your Majesty, I heard the news
about the Emperor's mistress.</i>

259
00:21:35,961 --> 00:21:41,633
<i>"Our parents were deeply shocked as well,
but they seemed concerned only for you.</i>

260
00:21:41,634 --> 00:21:43,885
<i>"I believe in you, Your Majesty.</i>

261
00:21:43,886 --> 00:21:45,720
<i>"I know how strong you are.</i>

262
00:21:45,721 --> 00:21:46,971
<i>"If only I were near you,</i>

263
00:21:46,972 --> 00:21:50,267
<i>"I would have beaten that rascal
until he was black and blue!</i>

264
00:21:51,018 --> 00:21:54,103
<i>"I will come to see you soon,
Your Majesty.</i>

265
00:21:54,104 --> 00:21:57,107
<i>"Until then, please stay well."</i>

266
00:22:53,080 --> 00:22:54,248
Oh!

267
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:57,000
Wow!

268
00:22:57,001 --> 00:22:58,502
Ooh!

269
00:23:01,964 --> 00:23:03,340
Look there!

270
00:23:32,620 --> 00:23:34,330
Careful,
don't damage the flowers.

271
00:23:35,331 --> 00:23:36,332
Hurry now!

272
00:24:43,691 --> 00:24:46,526
Why would he walk backwards like that?

273
00:24:46,527 --> 00:24:48,779
It's dangerous.

274
00:24:53,575 --> 00:24:56,661
We've allocated 110,000 krang
for the foreign delegation banquet

275
00:24:56,662 --> 00:24:59,372
and 50,000 krang
to enhance the military band

276
00:24:59,373 --> 00:25:00,623
for the commemorative parade.

277
00:25:00,624 --> 00:25:02,041
That sounds perfect.

278
00:25:02,042 --> 00:25:03,544
Thank you for your work.

279
00:25:04,211 --> 00:25:07,840
Your Majesty, we've received a request
for you to welcome a delegation.

280
00:25:08,674 --> 00:25:10,299
It's the Western Kingdom.

281
00:25:10,300 --> 00:25:11,468
The Western Kingdom?

282
00:25:12,594 --> 00:25:14,013
Yes, it's Prince Heinrey.

283
00:25:18,225 --> 00:25:20,059
COMMEMORATING THE 100TH ANNIVERSARY
OF THE FOUNDING

284
00:25:20,060 --> 00:25:21,729
OF THE EMPIRE NEW YEAR'S CEREMONY
ADDITIONAL BUDGET DOCUMENT

285
00:27:04,998 --> 00:27:07,584
It is my honor to meet you,

286
00:27:08,502 --> 00:27:09,753
my queen.

287
00:27:12,798 --> 00:27:16,093
I'm also honored to make
your acquaintance, Prince Heinrey.

288
00:27:24,393 --> 00:27:26,603
You must be tired after your long journey.

289
00:27:27,187 --> 00:27:30,816
You should rest here in the palace
until the New Year's Ceremony begins.

290
00:27:32,109 --> 00:27:34,987
The Eastern Empire's Imperial Palace
is renowned…

291
00:27:35,863 --> 00:27:37,321
for its great beauty.

292
00:27:37,322 --> 00:27:39,116
I'm certain you will like it.

293
00:27:40,868 --> 00:27:41,869
I'm already…

294
00:27:43,662 --> 00:27:44,913
enamored by it.

295
00:27:59,428 --> 00:28:02,388
Why are you staring so intently,
Your Highness?

296
00:28:02,389 --> 00:28:04,474
Please avert your gaze.

297
00:28:11,690 --> 00:28:15,276
I'd like to welcome Princess Circe
of the Southern Kingdom

298
00:28:15,277 --> 00:28:18,447
and Grand Duke Kaufman
of the Kingdom of Luipt.

299
00:28:35,797 --> 00:28:39,217
What has you so preoccupied,
Your Highness?

300
00:28:44,097 --> 00:28:45,181
Whoa!

301
00:28:45,182 --> 00:28:46,850
This… Hmm.

302
00:28:47,476 --> 00:28:49,435
Whoa!

303
00:28:49,436 --> 00:28:50,937
Whoa!

304
00:28:50,938 --> 00:28:52,605
This palace is just…

305
00:28:52,606 --> 00:28:55,025
so huge and lavish!

306
00:28:55,692 --> 00:28:57,109
Wow!

307
00:28:57,110 --> 00:28:59,820
This… this is from that place!

308
00:28:59,821 --> 00:29:03,616
Wow, the Eastern Empire
really is a bunch of thieves

309
00:29:03,617 --> 00:29:06,285
taking the spoils from the war
and putting them on display

310
00:29:06,286 --> 00:29:08,871
as if they had always belonged to them.

311
00:29:08,872 --> 00:29:10,456
Isn't that too much?

312
00:29:10,457 --> 00:29:11,750
Wow!

313
00:29:13,085 --> 00:29:14,211
Don't you think so?

314
00:29:15,337 --> 00:29:16,880
Uh… Your Highness?

315
00:29:19,549 --> 00:29:20,592
Your Highness!

316
00:29:21,468 --> 00:29:23,053
Are you going off somewhere again?

317
00:29:30,227 --> 00:29:31,310
I'll return soon.

318
00:29:32,437 --> 00:29:33,689
Where are you going?

319
00:29:34,731 --> 00:29:36,315
There are too many eyes!

320
00:29:36,316 --> 00:29:38,109
Your Highness!

321
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:39,568
Where are you going?

322
00:29:39,569 --> 00:29:42,405
Where are you… Ugh, seriously?

323
00:29:47,077 --> 00:29:48,995
You're coming back
from meeting the delegation

324
00:29:48,996 --> 00:29:50,122
of the Western Kingdom, aren't you?

325
00:29:50,706 --> 00:29:52,164
Please, do tell them.

326
00:29:52,165 --> 00:29:54,126
Is he really as beautiful as they say?

327
00:29:55,502 --> 00:29:57,336
I heard one of the maids
in the South Palace

328
00:29:57,337 --> 00:29:59,922
was so overwhelmed by his beauty
that she fainted.

329
00:29:59,923 --> 00:30:01,591
Oh, she fainted?

330
00:30:02,259 --> 00:30:03,384
Oh!

331
00:30:03,385 --> 00:30:04,928
Is he that beautiful?

332
00:30:11,226 --> 00:30:13,061
He was the most beautiful person

333
00:30:15,230 --> 00:30:16,605
that I've ever met.

334
00:30:16,606 --> 00:30:18,274
Such chiseled features!

335
00:30:18,275 --> 00:30:21,777
His appearance made me question
if he was even human.

336
00:30:23,321 --> 00:30:24,781
Did it really?

337
00:30:26,033 --> 00:30:28,576
Uh… what's his voice like?

338
00:30:28,577 --> 00:30:29,578
Yes?

339
00:30:32,706 --> 00:30:34,666
Out of everyone I've spoken to…

340
00:30:36,877 --> 00:30:38,502
his voice was the most lovely.

341
00:30:40,255 --> 00:30:41,797
A man like that…

342
00:30:41,798 --> 00:30:44,426
I'm not at all surprised
that rumors surround him.

343
00:30:45,302 --> 00:30:48,679
Even if he just stands quietly
and keeps to himself.

344
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,598
Oh, he has a beautiful voice, too?

345
00:30:50,599 --> 00:30:51,682
That's too much!

346
00:30:53,643 --> 00:30:55,686
I think we should be wary
of Prince Heinrey.

347
00:30:55,687 --> 00:30:57,480
He's very dangerous.

348
00:30:57,481 --> 00:30:59,523
I mean, one maid fainted.

349
00:30:59,524 --> 00:31:02,652
And you must have heard
what happened to that other maid.

350
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,491
Queen!

351
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:21,379
If he's responded so quickly,

352
00:31:22,005 --> 00:31:24,674
then surely your master is almost here.

353
00:31:27,677 --> 00:31:31,515
"I have arrived at the Imperial Palace.
Can you guess who I am?"

354
00:31:32,933 --> 00:31:33,934
Wait, he's with you?

355
00:31:47,072 --> 00:31:48,948
Where's your master?

356
00:31:48,949 --> 00:31:50,157
Is he among those guests?

357
00:31:57,541 --> 00:31:59,543
<i>I do not know who you are.</i>

358
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:03,463
<i>But tell me, do you know who I am?</i>

359
00:32:13,515 --> 00:32:15,517
-  Come on, hurry up.
-  Yes, sir.

360
00:32:16,101 --> 00:32:17,184
Yes, over there.

361
00:32:19,646 --> 00:32:21,523
Please, it is so very late.

362
00:32:22,107 --> 00:32:23,650
Go to bed, Your Majesty.

363
00:32:24,818 --> 00:32:27,028
I hope the rain ceases before the morning.

364
00:32:29,072 --> 00:32:30,073
Come now.

365
00:32:31,449 --> 00:32:34,493
You are the one who must shine
the brightest in this palace,

366
00:32:34,494 --> 00:32:35,912
so you cannot stay up late.

367
00:32:42,711 --> 00:32:44,920
Is the South Palace comfortable
for the guests?

368
00:32:44,921 --> 00:32:46,797
They are all in high spirits

369
00:32:46,798 --> 00:32:49,550
and seem to have no intention
of calling it a night.

370
00:32:49,551 --> 00:32:51,552
They're still drinking, my lady.

371
00:32:51,553 --> 00:32:53,721
- They are?
- What I've heard

372
00:32:53,722 --> 00:32:57,683
is the ladies are pining
so ardently over Prince Heinrey.

373
00:32:57,684 --> 00:32:59,768
They say they have formed ranks.

374
00:32:59,769 --> 00:33:01,478
Those who have exchanged words,

375
00:33:01,479 --> 00:33:03,189
those who have made eye contact,

376
00:33:03,190 --> 00:33:04,691
and those he has smiled at.

377
00:33:05,775 --> 00:33:09,153
I think what the ladies
really want to know is

378
00:33:09,154 --> 00:33:11,031
who the prince will dance with first.

379
00:33:12,532 --> 00:33:14,409
So which lady do you think is most likely?

380
00:33:15,202 --> 00:33:18,954
There are talks of Duchess Tuania,
others say Princess Circe.

381
00:33:18,955 --> 00:33:20,581
There are divided opinions.

382
00:33:20,582 --> 00:33:23,292
Although I'm sure
they're all thinking the same thing.

383
00:33:23,293 --> 00:33:26,420
They all wish he'll walk over to them,

384
00:33:26,421 --> 00:33:28,464
take their hand and dance the night away.

385
00:33:28,465 --> 00:33:29,798
What a dream!

386
00:33:33,428 --> 00:33:35,013
Good night, Your Majesty.

387
00:33:48,193 --> 00:33:49,861
Oh, my goodness!

388
00:34:01,957 --> 00:34:03,166
Oh, good heavens!

389
00:34:04,209 --> 00:34:05,376
It's raining so hard.

390
00:34:05,377 --> 00:34:07,545
Did your master really make you fly here?

391
00:34:13,260 --> 00:34:15,553
How long have you been waiting?

392
00:34:16,137 --> 00:34:17,180
Are you all right?

393
00:34:27,482 --> 00:34:31,611
<i>"Shall we make a bet?
Whoever finds the other first wins!"</i>

394
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:51,840
<i>"If it is a bet,
what will you wager?"</i>

395
00:35:04,227 --> 00:35:05,520
I cannot do this.

396
00:35:06,146 --> 00:35:08,148
I'm not sending you outside
in this weather.

397
00:35:10,817 --> 00:35:12,192
Why don't you stay here tonight?

398
00:35:13,945 --> 00:35:17,281
You will return to your master
when it stops raining.

399
00:35:37,636 --> 00:35:40,013
I find myself wondering
what your master's like.

400
00:35:42,515 --> 00:35:44,392
Is he sweet and clever, like you?

401
00:35:49,397 --> 00:35:51,858
<i>Come to think of it, Prince Heinrey…</i>

402
00:35:52,442 --> 00:35:54,735
<i>He has eyes as purple as yours.</i>

403
00:35:54,736 --> 00:35:57,280
I'm already enamored by it.

404
00:36:03,620 --> 00:36:05,664
You are so pretty, Queen.

405
00:36:10,001 --> 00:36:11,002
Good night.

406
00:37:48,975 --> 00:37:50,225
Begin.

407
00:37:53,688 --> 00:37:54,855
Good!

408
00:37:54,856 --> 00:37:56,940
Very good so far.

409
00:37:56,941 --> 00:37:59,067
Slowly. That's it.

410
00:37:59,068 --> 00:38:00,445
Keep your balance.

411
00:38:01,029 --> 00:38:02,488
Oh!

412
00:38:02,489 --> 00:38:03,697
Very good.

413
00:38:03,698 --> 00:38:05,532
Now we'll try without the book.

414
00:38:05,533 --> 00:38:07,409
There. Bup-bup-bup-bup-bup.

415
00:38:07,410 --> 00:38:08,912
You need to walk slower.

416
00:38:11,623 --> 00:38:12,790
Like this?

417
00:38:12,791 --> 00:38:14,833
That's right.

418
00:38:14,834 --> 00:38:17,961
You should always be mindful
of the maids' strides

419
00:38:17,962 --> 00:38:19,963
following behind you.

420
00:38:19,964 --> 00:38:23,133
Slowly, so the maids can follow…

421
00:38:23,134 --> 00:38:24,301
What are you doing?

422
00:38:24,302 --> 00:38:26,345
No, don't match your stride to theirs.

423
00:38:26,346 --> 00:38:27,513
If you aren't quick enough,

424
00:38:27,514 --> 00:38:29,097
then those lowly creatures
will step on your dress.

425
00:38:29,098 --> 00:38:31,850
Then how exactly should I walk?

426
00:38:31,851 --> 00:38:33,644
They should match what I do.

427
00:38:33,645 --> 00:38:34,978
You should walk in a way

428
00:38:34,979 --> 00:38:37,523
that never lets those following you
relax at all.

429
00:38:37,524 --> 00:38:40,651
That way, they never forget
that you are their mistress.

430
00:38:40,652 --> 00:38:42,820
This is hard!

431
00:38:42,821 --> 00:38:44,530
Well, yes, it should be hard.

432
00:38:44,531 --> 00:38:46,074
How are the writing lessons?

433
00:38:47,325 --> 00:38:49,993
Reading is a little easier,

434
00:38:49,994 --> 00:38:51,620
- the writing is…
- Hmm.

435
00:38:51,621 --> 00:38:54,373
Well then, it looks like
you will continue your lessons

436
00:38:54,374 --> 00:38:56,042
during the New Year's Ceremony.

437
00:38:56,668 --> 00:38:58,502
I'll be tired
after all the parties I'll attend.

438
00:38:58,503 --> 00:38:59,878
Listen.

439
00:38:59,879 --> 00:39:01,547
Relax your eyebrows. Shoulders straight.

440
00:39:01,548 --> 00:39:03,048
Chest up, too.

441
00:39:03,049 --> 00:39:04,174
Chin.

442
00:39:04,175 --> 00:39:05,635
Corners of your mouth.

443
00:39:06,344 --> 00:39:09,013
Next. Yes, your gaze.

444
00:39:09,639 --> 00:39:11,181
Mmm.

445
00:39:11,182 --> 00:39:12,433
Well done.

446
00:39:13,101 --> 00:39:14,310
Beautiful!

447
00:39:29,117 --> 00:39:32,287
Now, ladies, a busy day of preparation
is ahead. Understood?

448
00:39:32,996 --> 00:39:35,957
Of course. We've begun
the preparations already, Countess.

449
00:39:37,709 --> 00:39:39,126
- Ta-da!
- Ta-da!

450
00:40:33,473 --> 00:40:34,806
Countess?

451
00:40:34,807 --> 00:40:37,809
Do you think Rashta
will also be at the ceremony?

452
00:40:37,810 --> 00:40:39,811
I suppose she will attend.

453
00:40:39,812 --> 00:40:41,480
As the girl is now…

454
00:40:41,481 --> 00:40:43,774
a daughter of the Botulin House.

455
00:40:43,775 --> 00:40:47,235
His Majesty the Emperor
and Her Majesty the Empress.

456
00:41:44,002 --> 00:41:47,755
As you know, I played a part
in the war of a Hundred Years.

457
00:41:48,339 --> 00:41:50,424
I loyally followed my predecessor.

458
00:41:50,425 --> 00:41:53,052
It was so cold that even
the strongest liquor froze.

459
00:41:54,971 --> 00:41:56,972
The horses turned to ice in death.

460
00:41:56,973 --> 00:41:57,974
The frost…

461
00:41:58,683 --> 00:42:01,351
rendered the bread impossible to chew.

462
00:42:01,352 --> 00:42:03,854
The cold armor
clung to our skin so tightly

463
00:42:03,855 --> 00:42:05,731
that we could not even prize it off.

464
00:42:05,732 --> 00:42:08,734
<i>The cold armor
clung to our skin so tightly</i>

465
00:42:08,735 --> 00:42:10,820
<i>that we could not even prize it off,</i>

466
00:42:11,487 --> 00:42:16,284
<i>and only the hot blood of our enemies
could melt away the biting cold.</i>

467
00:42:17,702 --> 00:42:19,786
And only the hot blood
of our enemies

468
00:42:19,787 --> 00:42:21,789
could melt away the biting cold.

469
00:42:23,791 --> 00:42:25,293
When the Hundred Years' War ended,

470
00:42:26,169 --> 00:42:27,420
peace fell upon us all.

471
00:42:28,004 --> 00:42:29,421
And yet,

472
00:42:29,422 --> 00:42:32,966
our swords and our shields,
they have not rusted at all.

473
00:42:32,967 --> 00:42:34,384
This peace eternal

474
00:42:34,385 --> 00:42:38,389
can only be protected by readied armor
and a blade that shines.

475
00:42:39,182 --> 00:42:41,892
A blade that is ready to be drawn
at any moment.

476
00:42:41,893 --> 00:42:43,101
And I…

477
00:42:43,102 --> 00:42:45,020
will preserve and defend our empire.

478
00:42:45,021 --> 00:42:48,899
and we shall see that
this strength and peace lasts

479
00:42:48,900 --> 00:42:50,943
for 10,000 years.

480
00:42:56,324 --> 00:42:58,326
I share this glory with you.

481
00:43:12,632 --> 00:43:13,715
Join me!

482
00:43:13,716 --> 00:43:16,343
Long live His Majesty the Emperor!

483
00:43:16,344 --> 00:43:17,469
The Emperor!

484
00:43:17,470 --> 00:43:21,307
Long live Her Majesty the Empress!
The Empress!

485
00:43:34,487 --> 00:43:37,155
It has been a long time, Lady Albani.

486
00:43:37,156 --> 00:43:38,907
-  Lady Albani!
- Good to see you.

487
00:43:38,908 --> 00:43:40,827
Nice to meet you.

488
00:44:03,933 --> 00:44:06,060
I was hoping I could dance
with Rashta first.

489
00:44:07,854 --> 00:44:10,314
After all, our only rehearsal
was to this piece.

490
00:44:12,775 --> 00:44:14,443
I'll see you later.

491
00:44:15,153 --> 00:44:16,362
Your Majesty.

492
00:44:40,803 --> 00:44:42,555
What do we do?

493
00:45:08,414 --> 00:45:10,624
She seems to be following
what she was taught well.

494
00:45:10,625 --> 00:45:12,543
What a clever little thing.

495
00:45:28,893 --> 00:45:29,976
Majesty.

496
00:46:26,325 --> 00:46:27,326
It's all right.

497
00:46:28,244 --> 00:46:29,787
Like this.

498
00:46:30,538 --> 00:46:31,831
Mmm.

499
00:47:01,777 --> 00:47:02,778
McKenna.

500
00:47:04,280 --> 00:47:05,448
What's with the flower?

501
00:47:09,076 --> 00:47:11,662
There are many eyes watching here.

502
00:48:27,780 --> 00:48:29,697
My goodness!

503
00:48:32,201 --> 00:48:33,744
For the Empress?

504
00:48:44,755 --> 00:48:47,508
Are you a good dancer, Your Majesty?

505
00:48:59,145 --> 00:49:01,397
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS
